      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues miss analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.79 (down from ₹5.98 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹8.80b (down 11% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹276.9m (down 34% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 3.1% (down from 4.2% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Revenue missed analyst estimates by 21%. Earnings per share (EPS) also missed analyst estimates by 50%. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 35% per year whereas the company’s share price has fallen by 31% per year.",
