      "date": "2026-02-16T08:00:25.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.05 (vs ₹0.11 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.05 (down from ₹0.11 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.53b (down 19% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹4.29m (down 46% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.3% (down from 0.4% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 12% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 9.9% growth forecast for the Food industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 29% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 21% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
